OL,3,GNEWSAScaled back mosque planned for
OL,4,Aempty town site
OL,5,
OL,6,FVacant land in a town could house a
OL,7,Fmosque once again under revised plans
OL,8,Fscaling back the size of the building.
OL,10,FThe Muslim Federation of Cleveland
OL,11,Fwants to rebuild the Abu Bakr Mosque
OL,12,Fand Cultural Centre on the empty site
OL,13,Fon Park Road North in Middlesbrough,
OL,14,Fwhere members used to worship before
OL,15,Fthe buildings were demolished.
OL,17,FThe structures were pulled down to make
OL,18,Fway for a new mosque, which was
OL,19,Fapproved in 2012, but did not got ahead
OL,20,Fdue to "prohibitive costs associated
OL,21,Fwith the design".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
