OL,3,GNEWSAScaled back mosque planned for
OL,4,Aempty town site
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother planning application was lodged
OL,7,Fafter the previous one expired, but was
OL,8,Frefused in 2023. The development will
OL,9,Fbe entirely privately funded, according
OL,10,Fto the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,11,FService.
